WEBVTT

00:20:56.876 --> 00:21:01.132
because this the best way 
they can really achieve their potential.

00:21:03.657 --> 00:21:06.277
So, to me, it is really the Foundation

00:21:06.277 --> 00:21:08.359
looking at their investment 
in the language

00:21:08.359 --> 00:21:13.411
from those two perspectives, 
from renaissance and civilization,

00:21:13.411 --> 00:21:17.692
and the ability of providing 
that alternative, if you would like,

00:21:17.692 --> 00:21:21.052
a framework and alternative values,

00:21:21.052 --> 00:21:25.470
and at the same time being able 
to provide the needed means

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:29.041
for those societies to be able
to be linked to their history

00:21:29.041 --> 00:21:30.823
and the future at the same time.